    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 6th level, the atomic adept’s radiation pierces through thicker armor. Only a combined armor and shield bonus of 6 or greater or a natural armor bonus of 7 or greater reduce rads by half if cast by an atomic adept of 6th level or higher. This affects the caster’s rad gain as well.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/atomic-adept#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
